<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-536-10"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Dear {{lead.First Name:default= }},</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We're making the final preparations for the <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/annual-conference-awards-ceremony-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Flywire Annual Conference &amp; Awards Ceremony</u></strong></span></a>, and we can't wait to share an incredible experience with you!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We’ve curated an exciting agenda with insightful plenary sessions, interactive workshops, thought-provoking panel discussions, engaging breakout sessions, and our keynote speaker Colin MacLachlan, Former SAS Leader &amp; star of SAS: Who Dares Wins!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">As the day approaches, please take note of the important details below.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br /><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>4th-5th March 2025</strong></span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Windsor</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Optional pre-event activities will be held on 3rd March.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br /><a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/annual-conference-awards-ceremony-2025?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>View Agenda</u></strong></span></a></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br /><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Download the event app</strong></span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Please download the app <strong>before</strong> the conference using the email address you used to register. You will need access to this email address as you will receive an activation code. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">By downloading the conference app, you will be able to stay up-to-date with everything going on:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">See the full agenda</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Create your own personal schedule and select your workshops</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Pose questions to speakers and panel members</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">View essential conference information</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Connect with other attendees</span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">...and more.</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">You can download the app using the links below.</span></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="minw-158 hover-green" style="width: 100%;">
