<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Should you require any assistance, please email Sarah Christopher at <a style="color: #223341;" href="mailto:sarah.christopher@flywire.com">sarah.christopher@flywire.com.</a></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">&nbsp;</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">Accommodation if you haven’t booked it already</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Limited subsidised accommodation is available at the <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.devere.co.uk/beaumont-estate/?infinity=ict2~net~gaw~ar~644378847028~kw~de%20vere%20beaumont%20estate~mt~b~cmp~%5BUK%5D%20Hotel%20Names%20%5BDV%5D%20-%20Windsor%20-%20Beaumont%20Estate~ag~%5BUK%5D%20Hotel%20Names%20%5BDV%5D%20-%20De%20Vere%20-%20%28%29%20-%20Beaumont%20Estate%20-%20%28%29&amp;gad_source=1&amp;gclid=CjwKCAiAtt2tBhBDEiwALZuhAOmzhhI25-aRcFKqrAy6EuoSLYx9oXPSg4mSHwmv2nIGpfolPJ0I3xoCcZwQAvD_BwE&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>De Vere Beaumont Estate</u></strong></span></a> - £99 inc VAT single occupancy, per night, bed and breakfast. To book, please call 01753 640000, press 1 for bedroom reservations, then quote FLYWIRE2025.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">A card will be required when booking, for payment in advance. Cancellations: Please note that any cancellations received by the hotel less than 2 weeks prior to check in will be non refundable.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Don’t forget to get your outfits ready for the award ceremony!</strong></span></span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We're looking forward to celebrating the sector’s achievements with you. It’s a black-tie event, so don’t forget to get your outfits ready for the occasion! </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> </td> 
</tr> 
</tbody>
</table> </td> 
</tr> 
