<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 27px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Upcoming Events, Training and Community Meetings</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Join us at our upcoming events, training or Community Meetings:</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><br />Conferences:</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Payment Security &amp; Compliance Conference, 17th - 18th of June 2025, Manchester, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://em.flywire.com/MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGYb1pIldGp_5nTCjvUuYmOid1vtzwRM8Nxdj207fjo2fnXFLjARaTRCXQqqwfd_j3kYQW_Zqc=?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a><br />‌</span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Training:</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Payment Security Training, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://em.flywire.com/MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGYb1pIlTF9q-fqUWOiSNLrdBLqCtOGDtexdEsEV1TSiz46LtMqFmZ13yaFe0HG52YErP7HR8A=?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">AML &amp; Fraud Foundation Training, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://em.flywire.com/MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGYb1pIlVsWmFgR6V2qhsSMfaoYpZULB2QmE4l19OUOtijTBa2h__BwO6ql-5H0ZUqf-PbpoTQ=?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Best Practice Webinars, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://em.flywire.com/MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGYb1pIlfERKvc_IDRc44KNZEjuks6VrLGOas_Ob1mJLym1ORzAff6Dd0Hj_TirKUIslct6NM8=?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">WPM Product Training, <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://em.flywire.com/MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGYb1pIlQKqyB2xRRQ780g5KuNljyargC0IG7apMoQONhlrU7CvI2faGACWwP7IqP6qd0qfla4=?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Register Here</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Community Meetings:</span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>International Payments Community Meetings</strong> (previously called Nigeria Coffee Chat). Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJckc--rrDgtHN2L_9Ps7DyyprOcJjIR-XlF?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>3rd April</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Tribal Community Meetings</strong> - NEW for 2025: Join Flywire's inaugural Tribal Community Meeting hosted by Oliver Mussett, Flywire's Senior Strategic Partner Manager who oversees Flywire's partnership with Tribal, and has recently joined Flywire following eight years working for Tribal. Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://t.yesware.com/tt/85c45958e1017762e79a259b9435ea0f3f2adf6f/24445c4ec9f45afe39906ad5e6c4a4cf/a97f52c27b6b8559dc2025f50b18280e/flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJYrdOivqz4vHdVEfhk_8QhHkJEoqlT9Geuc?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>13th February</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Payment Security Community Meetings.</strong> Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://t.yesware.com/tt/85c45958e1017762e79a259b9435ea0f3f2adf6f/24445c4ec9f45afe39906ad5e6c4a4cf/772468b7ed3dd6b0f8632589c2a862a0/flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJUqcu2rpjgvH9BYLSa4NmVqJDS2sHG0Wo_m?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>26th March</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
<li><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>AML Community Meetings</strong> (previously called AML Special Interest Group). Next one: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywire.zoom.us/meeting/register/tJ0pd-qqqjwpH9yVZKSNku1ot8LS2EpW8zXu?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q3clientnewsletter&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=&amp;utm_campaign=&amp;mkt_tok=MzcyLVFTUS02NDkAAAGX2szJQ-Lw0oqavpz-PsYwoOwKCXbHwD0nQ5mVRjFki69ZXAYbt-gRw7Wn_UnBiibgU3RjMudTw1878Wz-2X0&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=#/registration"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>29th April</u></strong></span></a></span></li> 
</ul> </td> 
</tr> 
